Package: network-manager-defguard
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: network-manager-defguard contributors <noreply@github.com>
Depends: network-manager, defguard-client (>= 2.1.0), libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libgtk-4-1
Description: NetworkManager frontend for Defguard VPN
 Exposes enrolled Defguard locations as NetworkManager VPN profiles while
 Defguard continues to manage authentication and WireGuard configuration.
